WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.860
MALE SPEAKER: The name
"Pocket Gems" really speaks

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.920
to what we do, which is
make beautiful things

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.370
for your mobile device.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.839
We try to make games
that appeal to everybody.

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:09.630
MALE SPEAKER 2: Innovation
in mobile gaming

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.000
right now is really important.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.270
The social aspect to it seems
to be really, really important.

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:15.540
It's more engaging.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.730
People love to be able to
interact with other people.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.420
"War Dragons" was our
first online gameplay.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.740
So server scalability
is really important.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.870
In minutes or hours, you might
have hundreds of thousands

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.460
of players playing your game.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.930
If you don't have the
server infrastructure,

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.580
your server is just
going to explode.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:36.350
Google Cloud Platform
allows us to be

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:37.946
able to scale automatically.

00:00:37.946 --> 00:00:39.570
We don't even have
to think about that.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:41.560
If it needs more server,
it spins up servers.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.976
When it doesn't
need them anymore,

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:45.564
it just spins them down
in a matter of seconds.

00:00:45.564 --> 00:00:47.480
MALE SPEAKER: Our game
has evolved drastically

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.730
from the time of launch.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:51.962
And we used Google App Engine
to build AB testing tools

00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:53.920
where we could put out
different features as we

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.190
saw what people engaged
with and what they wanted.

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:59.010
Google App Engine and the
analytic tools behind it

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:01.260
were able to help us make
really good decisions on how

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.198
to evolve the game
over time as a service.

00:01:03.198 --> 00:01:04.739
MALE SPEAKER 2:
Google Cloud Platform

00:01:04.739 --> 00:01:07.000
allows us to focus
on what we love,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.570
doing the best games we
can, the games that are

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:11.200
going to delight our players.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.990
Your back end just works.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.075
It's almost magical.

00:01:14.075 --> 00:01:15.950
MALE SPEAKER: "Pocket
Gems" is really excited

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.600
be part of this
revolution, where

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.960
a billion people's first
experience with the internet

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:23.320
and with mobile is playing
products like ours.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.530
It's a real privilege to
be making our products

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:28.520
being the ones that are out
there bringing on this change.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.570
[MUSIC PLAYING]

